Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.35,0:00:21.77,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Estive sempre sonhando
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.77,0:00:25.94,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Enquanto minhas esperanças despedaçadas atravessavam o tempo
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.94,0:00:30.32,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Em busca de diferentes tipos de gentileza
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.32,0:00:36.08,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Olho para o céu e imagino seu sorriso
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.08,0:00:42.08,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Desde aquele dia vimos o mundo de forma diferente
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.08,0:00:44.83,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Meus sentimentos transbordam
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.83,0:00:50.71,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Para colocar sua confiança em alguém não é difícil
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.71,0:00:53.76,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Então, essas memórias me dizem
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.76,0:00:59.60,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Continuar por esta estrada escondida na luz e na sombra
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.60,0:01:02.69,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Todos esses sentimentos brilham
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.69,0:01:05.35,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Eu quero te proteger
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.35,0:01:11.07,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Abrace os laços que você sentir em seu coração
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.07,0:01:14.11,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}A hora de se levantar é agora
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.11,0:01:16.87,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Deixe sua tristeza de lado
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.87,0:01:19.74,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Duas almas vão em direção à verdade
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.46,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Procurando por aquele sorriso
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.46,0:01:29.42,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Esses sentimentos nos guiam em direção à verdade
